### ============ CATEGORIES ============

### List all categories (collection DTO: id + name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Read a single category (200) — paste an id from the list above
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75

### Read a non-existing category (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a category (201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Serology",
    "requiresFasting": false
}

### Update a category (204)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Serology and immunology",
    "requiresFasting": true
}

### Delete a category — cascades to its tests (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75

### ============ LAB TESTS ============

### List all tests (collection DTO: id + name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tests

### List tests of one category (200; empty category -> 200 with empty list)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75/tests

### List tests of a non-existing category (404 - different from empty!)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tests

### Read a single test (200; category flattened to its name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tests/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75

### Add a test to a category (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75/tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Platelets",
    "unit": "10^9/L",
    "referenceMin": 150,
    "referenceMax": 400,
    "price": 14.00
}

### Add a test to a non-existing category (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ghost",
    "unit": "x",
    "referenceMin": 1,
    "referenceMax": 2,
    "price": 1.00
}

### Add an invalid test - referenceMin > referenceMax (400 from validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75/tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Broken",
    "unit": "x",
    "referenceMin": 10,
    "referenceMax": 5,
    "price": 1.00
}

### Update a test (204)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tests/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75    
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Platelets",
    "unit": "10^9/L",
    "referenceMin": 140,
    "referenceMax": 420,
    "price": 15.00
}

### Delete a test (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tests/ee1867fa-a259-4544-9f3c-0c7e421a9f75
